Before We Begin

There are four concepts you should never confuse.

Concept	Purpose
Microsoft Entra ID	Identity Management
RBAC	Authorization (Permissions)
Service Principal	Identity for Applications
Managed Identity	Azure-managed identity for Azure resources
Authentication vs Authorization

This is one of the most common interview questions.

Authentication

Authentication answers:

Who are you?

Example:

Username
Password

Azure verifies your identity.

Authorization

Authorization answers:

What are you allowed to do?

Example:

Read Storage

Create VM

Delete Resource Group

These permissions are controlled using RBAC.

Real Example
Anusha
     │
     ▼
Login to Azure
(Authentication)
     │
     ▼
Reader Role
(Authorization)

You can view resources but cannot delete them.

What is Microsoft Entra ID?

Microsoft Entra ID (formerly Azure Active Directory) is Azure's cloud-based identity and access management service.

It manages:

Users
Groups
Applications
Service Principals
Managed Identities
Entra ID Architecture
